      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_af11662826055a1a8d5eec7fad5f07a492b635406f3402a2481dc4affb676e90"
      ],
      "text": "Stated design goals: help users understand their code, watch every change like a pair programmer, learn and adapt to the codebase, and integrate with compiler, terminal, debugger, Linear, and GitHub."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
