        "slc_68d1503df7cbd7c16ba65eb7701728edb96e778e2443d4adb84d5b17321a4284"
      ],
      "text": "A webview contract documents calling humanXYZ() on user actions, then startBotTurn() to return control, with stopBotTurn() as needed; task updates flow via updateTask, and an endBotTurn notification is planned but not yet needed."
    },
